日志路径找到了，TinecmaTool 把日志写在系统 TEMP 目录下的 `TinecmaTool\` 子目录里，文件名格式是 `<可执行名>_YYYY.MM.DD_HH.MM.SS.log`，源码位置：

```327:371:renderdoc/os/win32/win32_stringio.cpp
void GetDefaultFiles(const rdcstr &logBaseName, rdcstr &capture_filename, rdcstr &logging_filename,
                     rdcstr &target)
{
  wchar_t temp_filename[MAX_PATH];

  GetTempPathW(MAX_PATH, temp_filename);
  ...
  wsprintf(filename_start, L"TinecmaTool\\%ls_%04d.%02d.%02d_%02d.%02d.%02d.log", wbase.c_str(),
           1900 + now.tm_year, now.tm_mon + 1, now.tm_mday, now.tm_hour, now.tm_min, now.tm_sec);
}
```

Windows 上 `%TEMP%` 通常是 `C:\Users\Administrator\AppData\Local\Temp\TinecmaTool\`。注入相关的报错（`ThreadHijackInvoke ...`、`Thread-hijack DLL inject failed; falling back to CreateRemoteThread ...`、`Couldn't create remote thread for LoadLibraryW ...` 等）会落在 **qTinecmaTool 端**的日志，因为注入流程是在 UI 进程里跑的。

我直接列一下最近的日志看看现在出什么错。

The logging setup routes messages through RDCLOG/RDCWARN/RDCERR into timestamped log files in the temp directory — the UI process creates logs with "qTinecmaTool" in the filename, while injected processes log under their executable name like "Wuthering Waves". I'm realizing there might be an issue with how these logs are being organized or accessed.

